---
const int8 = ['1', '1', '1', '1', '1', '0', '1', '1'];
const exponent = '01111111';
const mantissa = '10000000000000000000000';
const bytes = ['12', '34', '56', '78'];
---

<div class="space-y-6 text-xs">
  <section>
    <div class="mb-2 flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-x-3 gap-y-1">
      <h4 class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-dim">Entero int8 · complemento a dos</h4>
      <span class="font-mono text-[10px] accent">-5 = 0xFB</span>
    </div>

    <div class="flex gap-1">
      {
        int8.map((bit, index) => (
          <span
            class:list={[
              'flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-sm border font-mono text-[11px]',
              index === 0
                ? 'accent-border accent-softer accent'
                : 'border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] text-muted',
            ]}
            title={index === 0 ? 'Bit de signo' : `Bit ${7 - index}`}
          >
            {bit}
          </span>
        ))
      }
    </div>

    <div class="mt-1.5 flex justify-between font-mono text-[9px] text-dim">
      <span class="w-7 text-center accent">S</span>
      <span>magnitud · 7 bits</span>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-2 text-[10px] leading-relaxed text-dim">
      El bit 7 pesa −128. Para negar: invierte todos los bits y suma 1.
      <span class="font-mono text-muted">0000 0101 → 1111 1010 → 1111 1011</span>.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="mb-2 flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-x-3 gap-y-1">
      <h4 class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-dim">Float32 IEEE 754 · 1.5</h4>
      <span class="font-mono text-[10px] accent">0x3FC00000</span>
    </div>

    <div class="overflow-x-auto pb-1">
      <div class="min-w-[600px]">
        <div class="flex gap-2">
          <div class="flex gap-px">
            {['0'].map((bit) => (
              <span class="accent-border accent-softer flex h-6 w-4 items-center justify-center rounded-sm border font-mono text-[10px] accent">
                {bit}
              </span>
            ))}
          </div>
          <div class="flex gap-px">
            {exponent.split('').map((bit) => (
              <span class="flex h-6 w-4 items-center justify-center rounded-sm border border-sky-300/15 bg-sky-300/[0.06] font-mono text-[10px] text-muted">
                {bit}
              </span>
            ))}
          </div>
          <div class="flex gap-px">
            {mantissa.split('').map((bit) => (
              <span class="flex h-6 w-4 items-center justify-center rounded-sm border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] font-mono text-[10px] text-muted">
                {bit}
              </span>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-1.5 flex gap-2 font-mono text-[9px] text-dim">
          <span class="w-4 text-center accent">S</span>
          <span class="w-[135px] text-center text-sky-300/70">exponente · 8 bits</span>
          <span class="flex-1 text-center">mantisa · 23 bits</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-1 text-[9px] text-dim sm:hidden">Desliza para ver los 32 bits →</p>

    <p class="mt-2 text-[10px] leading-relaxed text-dim">
      Valor = (−1)<sup>S</sup> × 1.mantisa × 2<sup>exp − 127</sup>. El exponente 01111111 es 127, así que
      este 1.5 se guarda como <span class="font-mono text-muted">1.1₂ × 2⁰</span>.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h4 class="mb-2 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-dim">Endianness · 0x12345678</h4>

    <div class="grid gap-2.5 sm:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-white/8 bg-black/20 p-3">
        <p class="font-mono text-[10px] text-muted">Big-endian <span class="text-dim">· red</span></p>
        <div class="mt-2 flex gap-1">
          {
            bytes.map((byte, index) => (
              <span
                class:list={[
                  'flex h-7 flex-1 items-center justify-center rounded-sm border font-mono text-[11px]',
                  index === 0
                    ? 'accent-border accent-softer accent'
                    : 'border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] text-muted',
                ]}
              >
                {byte}
              </span>
            ))
          }
        </div>
        <p class="mt-1.5 font-mono text-[9px] text-dim">dirección baja → alta · MSB primero</p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-lg border border-white/8 bg-black/20 p-3">
        <p class="font-mono text-[10px] text-muted">Little-endian <span class="text-dim">· x86, ARM</span></p>
        <div class="mt-2 flex gap-1">
          {
            [...bytes].reverse().map((byte, index) => (
              <span
                class:list={[
                  'flex h-7 flex-1 items-center justify-center rounded-sm border font-mono text-[11px]',
                  index === 3
                    ? 'accent-border accent-softer accent'
                    : 'border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] text-muted',
                ]}
              >
                {byte}
              </span>
            ))
          }
        </div>
        <p class="mt-1.5 font-mono text-[9px] text-dim">dirección baja → alta · LSB primero</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-2 text-[10px] leading-relaxed text-dim">
      El byte resaltado es el más significativo. Leer el mismo fichero con el orden equivocado produce
      <span class="font-mono text-muted">0x78563412</span>: parece corrupción, pero es solo convención.
    </p>
  </section>
</div>
